            Every dehumidifier here removes about the same amount of water, so do not choose on capacity. Choose on where the water goes and on whether you will know when the machine stops. For a basement you rarely visit, the Frigidaire 50-pint dehumidifier with Wi-Fi is the pick, because its phone alerts catch the full bucket or rising humidity before mold does.
          </p>
